{"about_the_game":"Gates to Terra II is a turn-based strategy where you will command multiple heroes, buy them items and outmatch your opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay against another player. Pick your team of 8 heroes with different traits. Experiment with different lineups and strategies to win!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n- Multiple possible combination of heroes and countless playstyles to choose from<br />\r\n- Practice with the AI or test your strategic skills in online play<br />\r\n- Customize your heroes and buildings with skins<br />\r\n- Rank-up to be the strongest player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nObjectives:<br />\r\n- capture all enemy Points OR<br />\r\n- destroy an enemy Camp OR<br />\r\n- get 10 hero kills<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n- click to select units<br />\r\n- right click to move around the camera<br />\r\n- mouse wheel to zoom in/out<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- keys 1,2,3,4 can be used as command shortcuts<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nRules:<br />\r\n- a Camp can summon an available hero per turn.<br />\r\n- a hero/unit can use &quot;move&quot;, &quot;attack&quot; and &quot;skill&quot; once per turn.<br />\r\n- you can buy up to 3 items for each heroes. Items are upgradable<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- a Point gives +20 gold per turn.<br />\r\n- slaying an enemy hero gives +200 gold.<br />\r\n- slain heroes takes 2 turns to revive before he can be summoned again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- each player has 3 mins. to make his turn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nCURRENT VERSION: v.0.6.1 Open Beta<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame is currently on Open Beta stage. Some changes might come on coming updates along with more content.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"74d341ce1e41242663c4e960d92b309e8a3278d8.jpg","localized_name":"First Victory","name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/74d341ce1e41242663c4e960d92b309e8a3278d8.jpg"},{"icon":"e7541f1c1cf8adcf2f5e791db469caa664c6e0bf.jpg","localized_name":"Distinguished Commander","name":"Distinguished Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/e7541f1c1cf8adcf2f5e791db469caa664c6e0bf.jpg"},{"icon":"ccbf48255d7dfd222a0148653327434da0d559b9.jpg","localized_name":"Master of War","name":"Master of War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/ccbf48255d7dfd222a0148653327434da0d559b9.jpg"},{"icon":"80b4d1675c6b5df837b2309035db53286d2b9865.jpg","localized_name":"Tactical Beatdown","name":"Tactical Beatdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/80b4d1675c6b5df837b2309035db53286d2b9865.jpg"},{"icon":"704abb439aa1945ad5c8f87b87b59024c182f3de.jpg","localized_name":"Royal Flush","name":"Royal Flush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/704abb439aa1945ad5c8f87b87b59024c182f3de.jpg"},{"icon":"24c51b49f6b429a7b290e71132b1a5ba8c3cafc9.jpg","localized_name":"Bulldozer","name":"Bulldozer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/24c51b49f6b429a7b290e71132b1a5ba8c3cafc9.jpg"},{"icon":"0b98d6e355dda3bdc196bd9e853c990d091146d9.jpg","localized_name":"An Epic Struggle","name":"An Epic Struggle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1180530/0b98d6e355dda3bdc196bd9e853c990d091146d9.jpg"},{"icon":"636f6c5d1c35da7cf797ec2902276f2ce21cfde0.jpg","localized_name":"Private Property","name":"Private Property","path":"https://cdn.akamai